      "type": "intro",
      "text": "ATMs — Requirements\n\nThe tables below list the validation rules that apply to the ATM API. The Validated by\n column indicates where each rule is enforced.\n\nAll requests require an active Trust Framework application\n with the BDSP\n role, a valid transport certificate\n presented on every request via mTLS, and an active signing key\n for JWT signing.",
